---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { api } from "../lib/api";

const email = "mmabayomi2208@gmail.com";
const github = "https://github.com/moAbayomi";
const linkedin = "https://www.linkedin.com/in/moabayomi/";

// The state-portal write-up lives in the wiki. Link it only if it exists so the
// resume never points at a 404. Create a note titled "State forms email" in
// /admin; it slugifies to this.
const STATE_NOTE_SLUG = "state-forms-email";
const directory = await api.notes.directory();
const stateNote = directory.find((entry) => entry.slug === STATE_NOTE_SLUG);
---

<Base
  title="Resume — Mo Abayomi"
  description="A snapshot of what I've built so far and what I'm learning."
>
  <div class="max-w-[48rem]">
    <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule pb-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-h2">Muhd Abayomi</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">
          developer · osun, nigeria · open to work
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/resume.pdf" class="bracket-link font-mono text-meta">pdf</a>
    </header>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-prose text-lede">
      I'm a developer who is still figuring things out, in public. I've been working on
      the web and I'm slowly moving toward systems — C, compilers, the lower layers. This
      is a snapshot of what I've done so far and what I'm trying to get better at, not a
      claim that I know it all.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">now</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-body">
        <li>
          Looking for work and collaborations where I can learn from people better than
          me — and ask a lot of questions.
        </li>
        <li>
          Teaching myself systems: working through K&amp;R and Nand2Tetris (building a
          computer and a compiler from scratch). Hard, and fun.
        </li>
        <li>
          Still getting comfortable with TypeScript, Postgres, and the unglamorous parts
          of shipping something real. Not a guru in web or systems yet.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        things i've built
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-6">
        <article>
          <h3 class="text-h3">This site</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">
            Astro · Hono · Postgres · Cloudflare
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-body text-muted">
            A personal wiki with a phone editor, wiki links, backlinks, revisions and
            search. I rebuilt it after an old server-rendered version turned into a bill
            and an outage. There is a
            <a href="/colophon" class="bracket-link">colophon</a> and a case study in the
            repository.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3 class="text-h3">Sales &amp; inventory</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">TypeScript</p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-body text-muted">
            An inventory and sales app for a fabric store: record stock, record sales,
            and track what sold and what's left. The live demo is password-protected, so
            the
            <a
              href="https://github.com/moAbayomi/inventory-wbsite"
              class="underline decoration-rule underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-accent"
            >
              code
            </a>
            is the useful part.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-meta text-muted">
        More on the <a href="/projects" class="bracket-link">projects</a> page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        where i've worked
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-5">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="text-h3">Developer</h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-meta text-muted">present</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-meta text-muted">
            M-Star Innovations Hub · Osogbo, Nigeria
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-body text-muted">
            <li>
              Added an email-delivery flow to a legacy PHP codebase that runs
              state-owned websites: after submitting a form, users enter their email and
              receive the details they submitted.
            </li>
            <li>
              Worked inside an unfamiliar stack and a codebase I didn't write, keeping
              the change small and compatible with the existing app.
            </li>
            {stateNote && (
              <li>
                <a href={`/${stateNote.slug}`} class="bracket-link">
                  A note on how it works
                </a>
              </li>
            )}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        tools i reach for
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-body">
        TypeScript, JavaScript, Astro, Hono, Postgres, Cloudflare Workers/Pages/R2,
        Tailwind, Git. Learning C and the systems side: pointers, memory, compilers.
        Comfortable learning whatever the problem needs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">learning</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-body">
        <li>
          <em>The C Programming Language</em> (K&amp;R) — working through it slowly.
          Humbling, but things are starting to stick.
        </li>
        <li>
          <em>Nand2Tetris</em> — building a computer and a compiler from the ground up.
          The hardest thing I've done in a while, and the most fun.
        </li>
        <li>Moving from web development toward systems programming.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        elsewhere
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 font-mono text-meta">
        <li><a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="hover:text-accent">{email}</a></li>
        <li><a href={github} class="hover:text-accent">github.com/moAbayomi</a></li>
        <li><a href={linkedin} class="hover:text-accent">linkedin</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
